  "description": "Na₃BiO₃ crystallizes in the cubic I̅43m space group. Na¹⁺ is bonded to five equivalent O²⁻ atoms to form a mixture of corner and edge-sharing NaO₅ square pyramids. There are a spread of Na-O bond distances ranging from 2.31-2.45 Å. Bi³⁺ is bonded in a distorted T-shaped geometry to three equivalent O²⁻ atoms. All Bi-O bond lengths are 2.08 Å. O²⁻ is bonded to five equivalent Na¹⁺ and one Bi³⁺ atom to form a mixture of corner and edge-sharing ONa₅Bi octahedra. The corner-sharing octahedral tilt angles are 18°.",
